                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2850192,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Stoic principles were based on the idea that its followers could have an unshakable happiness in this life, and the key to achieving this was virtue.",
                "meta": {
