                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2850219,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "The road to virtue, in turn, lay in understanding that destructive emotions like anger and jealousy are under our conscious control.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 166.445,
                  "from": 155.40501,
